---
description: DevSecOps guardrails
alwaysApply: true
---

## Security
- Least privilege env vars; do not leak tokens client-side.
- CORS must be explicit (no '*' in prod unless justified).
- Rate limit/backoff for upstream calls.
- Log safely: include requestId/latency/status; never log secrets.

## Supply chain
- Prefer pinned versions.
- If adding deps: justify + check license + avoid heavy transitive bloat.
